Fractional delay adapted from PyTDI
------------------------------------

speckit/lagrange.py (lagrange_taps, timeshift) and tests/unit/test_lagrange.py
are adapted from PyTDI:

Staab, Martin; Bayle, Jean-Baptiste; Hartwig, Olaf.
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8429119

speckit.dsp re-exports lagrange_taps and timeshift. Those two names in
speckit/dsp.py are the functions defined in speckit/lagrange.py.

