Flat-top windows
-----------------

speckit/flattop.py is SpecKit code covered by the LICENSE file. The cosine
coefficients and the recommended overlaps are the values published by
Heinzel, Rüdiger, and Schilling, "Spectrum and spectral density estimation
by the Discrete Fourier transform (DFT), including a comprehensive list of
window functions and some new flat-top windows", Max-Planck-Institut für
Gravitationsphysik, 15 February 2002.
